@host = http://localhost:5278

### List products
GET {{host}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=10

### List products by name
GET {{host}}/api/products?name=mouse&page=1&pageSize=10

### Create order
POST {{host}}/api/orders

### List orders
GET {{host}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=10

### List open orders
GET {{host}}/api/orders?status=Open&page=1&pageSize=10

### Get order
GET {{host}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Add product (Mouse)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Remove product (Mouse)
DELETE {{host}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/items/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Close order
POST {{host}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/close

### Seeded products
### Notebook  11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111  3500
### Mouse     22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222  100
### Teclado   33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333  200
